her the heavy curtain presses inward against the closed window, as if leaned on from outside, and holds there. ID_A is talking, saying in a Boston accent, \\\"Okay, so, the window has been latched since March, and something still likes to lean on the curtain.\\\" ID_A's lips move naturally in tight sync with every word, opening on the vowels and closing fully on the consonants. ID_A is the only person speaking in this shot, and the only voice on the audio track is ID_A's. One continuous line with natural breaths and brief pauses. Quiet diegetic sound only: the lamp filament buzzing faintly, floorboards settling, her voice close and dry on the camcorder mic.\n---\nConsumer camcorder video, 1080p, modest dynamic range, saturated color, slight edge softness: a locked static medium close-up at eye level, ID_A alone in frame, head and shoulders filling most of the frame and the mouth fully visible. The camcorder stays locked on one unbroken angle that never cuts and never changes viewpoint. The room is a bare dim bedroom lit by a single lamp with a scorched shade, plain plaster walls with hairline cracks, bare wooden floorboards, and a heavy curtain drawn over the only window. ID_A is a young American woman in her mid twenties, quiet and still, with very pale matte skin, visible pores across the nose and cheeks, faint shadows under her eyes, dry lips, no makeup, long dark brown hair loose and slightly tangled past her shoulders, and a plain ankle-length long-sleeved white cotton dress. Her voice is a low quiet young woman's voice with a Boston accent. The lamp behind her brightens slowly past its normal glow until the scorched shade begins to smoke faintly at the rim. ID_A is talking, saying, \\\"Right, well, the lamp only does this when I talk about it, which is why I stopped talking about it.\\\" ID_A's lips move naturally in tight sync with every word, opening on the vowels and closing fully on the consonants. ID_A is the only person speaking in this shot, and the only voice on the audio track is ID_A's. One continuous line with natural breaths and brief pauses. Quiet diegetic sound only: the lamp filament buzzing faintly, floorboards settling, her voice close and dry on the camcorder mic."]}],"links":[[1,1,0,6,0,"MODEL"],[2,7,0,8,4,"STRING"],[3,2,0,8,0,"CLIP"],[4,3,0,8,1,"VAE"],[5,1,0,10,0,"MODEL"],[6,8,0,10,1,"CONDITIONING"],[7,9,0,11,0,"NOISE"],[8,10,0,11,1,"GUIDER"],[9,5,0,11,2,"SAMPLER"],[10,6,0,11,3,"SIGMAS"],[11,8,1,11,4,"LATENT"],[12,11,0,12,0,"LATENT"],[13,3,0,12,1,"VAE"],[14,11,0,13,0,"LATENT"],[15,4,0,13,1,"VAE"],[16,12,0,14,0,"IMAGE"],[17,13,0,14,1,"AUDIO"],[18,14,0,15,0,"VIDEO"],[19,7,1,16,4,"STRING"],[20,2,0,16,0,"CLIP"],[21,3,0,16,1,"VAE"],[22,12,0,17,0,"IMAGE"],[23,17,0,16,2,"IMAGE"],[24,1,0,19,0,"MODEL"],[25,16,0,19,1,"CONDITIONING"],[26,18,0,20,0,"NOISE"],[27,19,0,20,1,"GUIDER"],[28,5,0,20,2,"SAMPLER"],[29,6,0,20,3,"SIGMAS"],[30,16,1,20,4,"LATENT"],[31,20,0,21,0,"LATENT"],[32,3,0,21,1,"VAE"],[33,20,0,22,0,"LATENT"],[34,4,0,22,1,"VAE"],[35,21,0,23,0,"IMAGE"],[36,22,0,23,1,"AUDIO"],[37,23,0,24,0,"VIDEO"],[38,7,2,25,4,"STRING"],[39,2,0,25,0,"CLIP"],[40,3,0,25,1,"VAE"],[41,21,0,26,0,"IMAGE"],[42,26,0,25,2,"IMAGE"],[43,1,0,28,0,"MODEL"],[44,25,0,28,1,"CONDITIONING"],[45,27,0,29,0,"NOISE"],[46,28,0,29,1,"GUIDER"],[47,5,0,29,2,"SAMPLER"],[48,6,0,29,3,"SIGMAS"],[49,25,1,29,4,"LATENT"],[50,29,0,30,0,"LATENT"],[51,3,0,30,1,"VAE"],[52,29,0,31,0,"LATENT"],[53,4,0,31,1,"VAE"],[54,30,0,32,0,"IMAGE"],[55,31,0,32,1,"AUDIO"],[56,32,0,33,0,"VIDEO"],[57,21,0,34,0,"IMAGE"],[58,22,0,35,0,"AUDIO"],[59,30,0,36,0,"IMAGE"],[60,31,0,37,0,"AUDIO"],[61,12,0,38,0,"IMAGE"],[62,34,0,38,1,"IMAGE"],[63,38,0,39,0,"IMAGE"],[64,36,0,39,1,"IMAGE"],[65,13,0,40,0,"AUDIO"],[66,35,0,40,1,"AUDIO"],[67,40,0,41,0,"AUDIO"],[68,37,0,41,1,"AUDIO"],[69,39,0,42,0,"IMAGE"],[70,41,0,42,1,"AUDIO"],[71,42,0,43,0,"VIDEO"],[72,46,0,8,5,"INT"],[73,46,0,25,5,"INT"],[74,46,0,16,5,"INT"],[75,46,1,8,6,"INT"],[76,46,1,25,6,"INT"],[77,46,1,16,6,"INT"],[78,47,0,8,7,"INT"],